<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi Electric sees 6-mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi Electric sees 6-mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			 (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS</p>
<p> (parent)	     FORECAST	  8-MTH RESULT</p>
<p> Sales		117.00	     138.59</p>
<p> Current		3.00		 3.37</p>
<p> Net	     prft 1.20	  loss 1.91</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 23.17 yen   loss 36.88 yen</p>
<p> Ord div		7.00 yen	   5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd makes electronic parts,</p>
<p>especially system components. Latest forecasts are for six</p>
<p>months to March 31, 1997. The comparison figures were</p>
<p>actual results for the eight-month period ended on September</p>
<p>30, 1996, because the company changed its business term.</p>
</text>
